==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Hdd od srodka.jpg|right|thumb|Photograph of a hard disk drive, showing the platter inside.]]
'''[[hard]] [[drive]]'''

# A device used for storing large amounts of [[data]] for a [[computer]], currently ranging from as low as 4 [[gigabyte|GB]], to as high as 1 [[terabyte|TB]].

# The bulk of the memory of a personal computer is magnetically stored on hard disks that constitute the hard drive. Information in the hard drive is durable, in that it remains magnetically stored when the computer is turned off.
